// =============================================================
// RECOMMENDED ADDITIONS LIBRARY (v66)
// Curated list of commonly-missed commercial GC precon tasks generated
// from the gap analysis. Each entry is opt-in — user picks which ones to
// add to their template via the Recommendations modal.
//
// Each recommendation has:
//   stage:    a stage id (existing or new — see RECOMMENDED_STAGES below)
//   title:    task title
//   category: CSI division / tag
//   source:   typically '' or 'Other' / 'OneDrive (SBG)' / etc.
//   offset:   integer offset from anchor
//   dateAnchor: 'bid-start' or 'bid-day'
//   estimatedHours: optional hours estimate
//   critical: optional critical flag
//   requiresSenior/Lead1/Lead2: optional role flags
//   impact:   'high' | 'medium' | 'low' — used for filtering
//   rationale: short text explaining WHY (shown in modal, stripped on import)
//   tips:     optional template-task tip text (carried through to imported task)
//   checklist:    optional array of {text, required} (carried through)
//   deliverables: optional array of strings (carried through)
//
// NEW STAGES — five recommended stages not in DEFAULT_STAGES. When a user
// opts into a task from one of these stages, the stage is auto-created
// in state.stages before the task is added.
// =============================================================

